  "abstract": "<jats:p>\n                    We present a silicon microring modulator with a T-Coil, achieving a 1 dB electro-optic bandwidth exceeding 110 GHz. Driven with 1 V\n                    <jats:sub>pp</jats:sub>\n                    , it supports 416 Gbps PAM4 transmission with a TDECQ of 2.88 dB.\n                  </jats:p>",
